<title>USA: Eckler names Fred Whaley CFO.</title>
<headline>Eckler names Fred Whaley CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TITUSVILLE, Fla. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eckler Industries Inc said on Tuesday it named Fred Whaley as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Eckler, which changed its name to Smart Choice Automotive Group Inc, said Whaley was previously a managing director at Raymond James &amp; Associates.</p>
<p>The name of the previous chief financial officer was not immediately available.</p>
